---
// Style guide section: Breakpoints
// Markup ported word for word from the original case-study.html.
---
<section class="section_style-guide-breakpoints" data-pane="style-guide" id="sg-breakpoints">
      <div class="padding-global padding-section-medium"><div class="container-large">
        <div class="heading_component is-narrow" data-anim=""><span class="text-style-eyebrow text-color-brand">13</span><h2 class="heading-style-h3">Breakpoints</h2><p class="text-color-secondary">Webflow's default breakpoints, designed mobile-first for the 35% of traffic on phones.</p></div>
        <div class="style-guide_attrs is-4-columns" data-anim-group="">
          <div class="style-guide_attr"><p class="heading-style-h4">Desktop</p><p class="style-guide_code">992 and up</p><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">Two-column blocks, centered section titles, hero art on both sides.</p></div>
          <div class="style-guide_attr"><p class="heading-style-h4">Tablet</p><p class="style-guide_code">991</p><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">One column, titles aligned left, testimonials as a carousel, founder in two columns.</p></div>
          <div class="style-guide_attr"><p class="heading-style-h4">Mobile landscape</p><p class="style-guide_code">767</p><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">Sticky CTA, full-width buttons, hero photos at the bottom, smaller type.</p></div>
          <div class="style-guide_attr"><p class="heading-style-h4">Mobile portrait</p><p class="style-guide_code">479</p><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">H1 at 2.25rem and tighter cards.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div></div>
    </section>
